exercise: bag of {r} red {b} green {w} yellow marbles, no looking. how many u gotta pull to be sure {k} match
exercise: {r} red, {b} blue, {w} white socks in the dark, need {k+1} — no wait, {k} the same colour. least number to grab
exercise: Sam says just grab {k}. nah. {r} red {b} blue {w} white socks, lights off, how many to be sure of {k} same colour
test: box w {r} red, {b} green, {w} blue pencils, eyes shut. fewest {a} takes so {k} are same colour for sure
